# Spec 27: inside the zoomed diagram the wheel zooms about the pointer (the diagram is drawn again at that size, so it stays
# sharp), a drag pans, `0` and a double click are back to the fit, a click without a drag closes it.
size 900 700
open zoom-pan.md
shot page.png
click 450 190
shot fit.png
wheel -5 300 350
shot zoomed.png
drag 500 350 300 380
shot panned.png
keys 0
shot reset.png
